- **The ruling:** the standing ruling of 2026-11-04 ("go with recommended on anything else that comes up", "and by hand") covers this landing. The asks the unit named are taken as recommended and named on the PR:
  - (a) a non-final gate step's refused word fails the attempt;
  - (b) the single-seat ceiling also covers select cases;
  - (c) the list-less default binds no shipped member;
  - (d) the prompt-budget, witness and public-API rises;
