SCRATCHES and REVIEW: as .forge/fires/commissions/0106a.md. Every review position is READ-ONLY: do not commit, reset, check out, build or write anywhere in this worktree, test files included. Scratch only under your own TMPDIR, in a `git archive HEAD | tar -x` copy; a copy that runs brokkr-cli's tests needs `git init` first. The panel reviews THIS UNIT, f26bccaea to your head. 0109a1 is reviewed and is not re-reviewed here, except where this unit changes its code.

**Each finding names the writer it needs**, as one of:
- (i) a seat's result through the driver protocol;
- (ii) a recipe author;
- (iii) an engine path: a bug, contention or a crash;
- (iv) a direct write to the journal by a process of the account.
For (iv), say whether that writer could instead write a whole, consistent record that every check admits. Each position reports findings with their severity and evidence, and does not state a verdict. The chief decides the outcome.

